  SpeakerName: Narrator
  DialogueText: " Ah, there it is. Confidence! Finally, And to think, just moments
    ago our player was wandering around choosing doors like a lost toddler in a supermarket.
    But look at them now - standing tall, chest puffed, ready to dazzle a studio
    with their balls.\r\n Don\u2019t disappoint them now. I\u2019ve hyped you up.
    And if there\u2019s one thing I despise, it\u2019s wasted hype.\r\n"
